* Calculates Cross-Country Team Scores for 5K
* When to use:      Use this when you need to generate a team standings report based on finishing places.
* How to use:       Ensure your CLUB (or team) field is populated.
Header
.include            racename.5K

----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                          TEAM Results - 5K
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.End of Header
Select              Race
=                   5k
.include            fieldlst
Event               Finish
Team Field          CLUB
Team Score          5
Team Displace       7
 